From 2f3477913c5717ad10835bc33ca92ee81bfddb05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:28:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] fix(gateway): managed Bot Chat follows profile; held
 pick ends durably

- session_policy: effective_selection() reports a recorded pick that ended on the same profile read.
- session_profile_selection: the owner's fenced commit (epoch + generation + receipt policy) drops
  model.selection_profile from the receipt when the pick ended, then republishes the live policy,
  so a composer hold never resurrects when the profile returns to its original target.
- session_managed_worker: one profile read feeds route, selection commit and hold end.
- test: align the owner's state.db with its profile home (root conftest re-points
  hermes_state.DEFAULT_DB_PATH after first import, so later tests silently stopped following);
  add durable-end and re-pick-after-end coverage.
---
 gateway/session_managed_worker.py             |  5 +-
 gateway/session_policy.py                     | 13 ++++-
 gateway/session_profile_selection.py          | 42 +++++++++++++---
 tests/gateway/test_bot_chat_managed_follow.py | 49 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 97 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

